{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351460","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351460","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035146001:1":{"text":"이 다리요? 친구, 모든 건축물에 역사가 있는 건 아니에요.","source_cn":"这座桥？朋友，不是所有建筑都有历史。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F233500E385D1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035146002:1":{"text":"하지만 건축양식과 공예로 보아, 성석 마을이 세워졌을 때와 비슷한 것 같네요.","source_cn":"不过从建筑风格和工艺来看，应该与圣石镇建立的时间差不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9330B23302AF4BA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者维娜":{"text":"학자 베르나","source":"冬青学者维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}